# Pneumatic Heights (CIPlay pneumatic_heights_solo; in the plan after Parcel Canopy, from day 10): quest "By Tube"
# (it needs the telegraphist's dead letter from The Dead Letter Office: pneumatic_heights_solo.play reads it first)
island Pneumatic Heights
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title By Tube
expect hidden capsule1
expect hidden capsule2
expect hidden rats
expect hidden reply
zone harbour_steps
expect step 1
read Exchange instructions
expect step 2
use tubehub
expect message not all turned
use valve1
use valve2
use valve3
expect story valve 3
expect step 3
use tubehub
expect shown capsule1
expect step 4
read Capsule 1
expect step 5
open House 4 letterbox
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect shown rats
expect step 7
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
expect step 8
use tubeb
expect shown capsule2
expect step 9
read Capsule 2
expect step 10
open Exchange vault
expect message keypad
code vaultpad 1111 wrong
code vaultpad 3109
open Exchange vault
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_MetalDetector 1
expect step 12
open Festival crate
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Firework 1
expect step 14
open Linesman's locker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect step 16
use chute
expect story telegraphdelivered 1
expect shown reply
expect step 17
read Telegraphist's reply
expect step 18
zone tower_roof
expect done
